+        // [BACH] The A10 QCamera HAL on bach encodes a valid JPEG but returns the BLOB gralloc
+        // buffer with STATUS_ERROR, so A11 would drop it (notifyError ERROR_CAMERA_BUFFER) and
+        // the app would never receive the image ("capture error on unknown request ID"). Trust
+        // the encoded JPEG: flip a BLOB buffer's ERROR status back to OK so it is delivered to the
